course: dictionary
lesson: 5601
title: Many meanings of life
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: The word life can mean different things, so read the sentence around it to find out which meaning it has. «A butterfly's life cycle is egg, caterpillar, chrysalis and adult butterfly.» Here life means the stages a living thing goes through from start to finish.
explain: «Each person has one life on this earth; nobody else can live it for them.» Here life means the time from when someone is born until they die. Try it: swap in «time alive» and the sentence still makes sense.
explain: Life can also mean a way of living, as in «a busy life» or «city life». Always ask: what word would fit here? Then try your meaning in the sentence and check that it still makes sense.
fact: Life is a noun. A life is one person's whole time alive, and lives is the plural.
fact: Living things, such as people, animals and plants, have life. Stones do not, because they do not grow, feed, breathe or reproduce.
fact: «Rodents have spread into almost every way of life» means the many different ways that rodents live.
fact: A «life jacket» keeps you afloat in water, and a «lifeguard» helps to save a life.
fact: In a game, a life is one of the chances you have before the game ends.
exercise: In «A butterfly's life cycle is egg, caterpillar, chrysalis and adult butterfly», what does life mean? | A kind of bicycle | *The stages a living thing goes through from start to finish | A type of bug | Energy and fun
exercise: «Each person has one life on this earth.» What does life mean here? | Living things in general | *The time from birth until death | A chance in a game | Energy and fun
exercise: Which of these has life, according to the meaning of being alive? | *A growing plant | A pebble | A cup | A rock
test: «Rodents have spread into almost every way of life.» What does life mean here? | A chance in a game | Energy and fun | *The way creatures live | Being alive
test: A player says, «I have three lives left.» What does life mean in a game? | A life jacket | The time from birth until death | Plant life in a forest | *One of the chances to keep playing before the game ends
exam: «Some scientists think life on Earth may have started at vents, but nobody knows for sure.» What does this sentence tell you? | Life has never started on Earth | Life began at vents for certain | *Scientists are not yet certain where life began | Vents are a kind of life jacket
